# Pairs with FeatureOffInert. Every delegated facade verb except the posture
# refuses while the flag is off.
MODULE: MemberFacadeIgnoresFlag
TARGET: FeatureOffInert
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the member-set verb writes while delegated access is off
PERTURBS: AddMemberEntry

--- FIND
          ELSE IF ~fl THEN Refuse("addMember", auth, fl, "disabled", FALSE)
--- REPLACE
          ELSE IF FALSE THEN Refuse("addMember", auth, fl, "disabled", FALSE)
--- END
